  "name": "00 - Credit Repair Orchestrator",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 00 \u2014 Pipeline Orchestrator\n\nThe conductor. Runs hourly, picks up cases whose 3-day cancellation window has **closed** and that have not yet started, and runs the automated pipeline:\n\ningest -> analyze -> draft letters -> notify for review.\n\nIt deliberately **stops at letter review**. Dispatch (05) only fires after a human approves. Tracking (06) runs on its own daily schedule.\n\n**After importing all workflows, open each Execute Workflow node and select the matching workflow** \u2014 IDs cannot be hard-coded across instances.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "86222eb3-0347-4594-997f-0ec0ebfffa5e",
      "name": "Note c48d0c65",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
